[SAFe Coach]: "You don't lose it—you invest it. By reserving 20% for Enablers, your pipelines run faster and safer. By spending 10% on Tech Debt, bug tickets drop by 50%. In 2–3 sprints, your total velocity increases because the team stops spending time firefighting."

